WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:03.940
See this?

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:08.360
It's the Slates we stole from your previous king after he was defeated.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.980
Yeah, so?

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.900
I don't really care.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.860
Well you should!

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:19.120
Now that you're a J-Rank, you're not just a player,

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.450
but also an administrator of the game.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.870
But don't let it go to your head.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.420
Just because you beat my record

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.090
for becoming a J-Rank in the shortest time doesn't mean...

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.590
Oh, I get it.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.550
Huh?

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:34.930
You're sulking 'cuz I beat your score.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:36.760
Man, you're such a pain...

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.010
What?!

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.770
You only made it this fast because
you had help from Hirasaka!

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:47.900
I can't stand guys like you
who rely on other players to win!

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.530
I depend on no one.

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:52.900
But I will use tools.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.780
After all, that's what I specialize in.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.410
Say, wanna go for a round against me?

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.750
We'll each put up 10,000 points.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.210
I'll go real easy on you just to make things fair.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:10.590
Sounds like a pain...

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.130
Don't worry, I won't kill you.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:14.590
After all, we're "comrades," right?

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.470
Hey, will you cut it out...

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:22.930
Both of you!

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.190
Stop being so hostile to each other.

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:30.980
It's not pretty at all.

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.070
Caw!

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:35.070
Why do I have to get hit?

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:38.070
You and your brute strength, Yukari...

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:41.990
Listen, it's fine to fight amongst yourselves.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:44.120
But this is a very critical time.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.080
We need you to act more responsible.

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:49.830
Soon the Slates will bloom.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:53.210
At this rate, it's just a matter of time.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:57.840
And then Nagare's new stage begins, right?

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.760
I'm ready for it.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.470
Sukuna-chan is just a child, after all.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:06.430
But he's strong.

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:09.900
He's far from being polished,
but when it comes to raw power...

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.690
He's my equal, or more than that.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:16.610
If he challenges you again, I would turn him down.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:16.820
A clan consisting of two Kings,

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.200
<i>I'm ready anytime!</i>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:18.450
two clansmen, and one bird...

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.030
<i>You can count on me!</i>

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.620
<i>After all, it's our new stage!</i>

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.620
Yet you all interact with one another
as equals, even to the kings.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.710
What a strange place.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.040
You think so?

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:32.380
Well, that kind of era is coming...

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.380
Where each individual will have his own power,

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:36.380
unsupervised by anyone.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:39.800
An age where you take responsibility for your own life with your own power.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.300
I think it will suit you very well.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.020
I guess this really is the only option...

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.290
I demand an explanation!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.750
Why is the Captain being dismissed?!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.000
It's quite simple.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.170
I had Munakata-kun step down
as captain, effective yesterday,

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.260
to take responsibility for the incident

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:45.760
that occurred at Mihashira Tower over Christmas.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.890
In other words, he was fired.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.140
Mr. Prime Minister,

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.310
what authority do you have to do such a thing...?

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.190
But I do have the authority.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.690
The executive rights for SCEPTER 4 rests

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:02.570
with the Legal Affairs Bureau
Civil Registry Department Division 4.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:05.820
Ultimately, you are all public servants.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.280
You have a duty to abide by orders
issued by the government.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.280
Yes, but...

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.830
You were able to act arrogantly until now

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:17.580
due to the influence of
His Excellency, Kokujoji Daikaku.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:22.800
It seems Munakata-kun had the gall
to try to take His Excellency's place.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.170
And look at the result?

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.970
His Excellency had protected
our treasure for nearly seventy years...

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.640
No sooner than it was placed
under Munakata-kun's supervision...

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.060
it was stolen, within a mere two months.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.690
You cannot deny that he was unqualified.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:41.070
Munakata-kun has already agreed
to his dismissal as captain.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:42.570
What...?!

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:46.780
The rest of the members are to
stand by for further instructions.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.570
Here is the order.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.490
With just a sheet of paper...

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.330
An important sheet of paper.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:56.580
I value regulation above all else.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.460
Damn it!

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.960
What do you mean the Captain's been fired?!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.460
Where is he, anyway?!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.460
Calm down, Domyoji!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:08.590
The government never interfered like this before.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.010
Do you suppose it has anything
to do with the rumors

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:13.850
of the executive branch members
being tied to the Greens?

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.180
First Fushimi-san defects to
the Greens, and now this...

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:19.850
It's like one unthinkable thing
happening after another...

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.070
I wish I knew what they were thinking...

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:25.150
Both the Captain and Fushimi-san!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.670
Oh, Anna...

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.170
Thank goodness you're back.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.800
Where've you been, Anna?!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.720
I went to meet with Yashiro.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.260
If you told me, I would've taken you!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.220
It's pretty dangerous out there now.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:58.480
I'm sorry.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.230
By the way, Anna...

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:03.480
Sounds like Munakata-han got into a lot of trouble.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:09.030
I can't believe a country can fire a king.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:13.620
It was so sudden, SCEPTER 4
seems to be in an uproar.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:18.660
The members are on stand-by and
not allowed to leave home base.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.620
I hope Seri-chan is okay.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:25.170
There were a lot of government types among the guests

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:29.380
at the JUNGLE party that Seri-chan and I snuck into.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:34.300
I guess it means the government
chose the Greens over the Blues.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:37.810
At this rate, the whole world will turn green.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.390
Is that why then?

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:40.390
Yata-chan?

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:45.310
Is that why Saruhiko jumped a sinking ship...

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.860
and betrayed everyone...

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.400
and switched to the Greens?

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:51.530
Misaki...

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.530
Well...

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.490
I'm gonna go patrol the area again.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:09.210
Anna, how did it go with Shiro-san?

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:11.760
Anna?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.970
Yashiro completed his research.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:15.970
You mean...

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.970
He's going to destroy the Slates.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.020
I see...

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:28.070
So Shiro-san finally found a way to do that...

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.070
Yashiro made up his mind...

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.990
To destroy the Slates...

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.110
The symbol of his dreams.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.870
You sure you're okay with this, Anna?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.500
The Slates took so much away from me...

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.460
But... I love this red.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.630
This red saved me.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.010
Anna...

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.140
Still... I don't mind losing it.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:02.060
All my life, all I could do was
watch fate unfold from the sides.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.520
But it's different now.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.400
If my fate as the Red King is to destroy...

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:11.530
Then I'll destroy the fate that
tries to hurt the ones I care about.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.740
Okay, I understand.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:17.450
Ever since I found those
documents back in Germany,

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.530
I knew this day was bound to come.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.290
All that's left is...

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.420
Reisi...

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.300
Hello.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:37.640
What, may I ask, was the purpose for calling me out so abruptly, Red King?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.260
I wanted to speak to you.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.730
We are going to destroy the Slates.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.060
I see.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.480
Well, I agree that it's certainly one option

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.570
to break the current deadlock.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.820
So you smoke?

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:01.410
I only smoke on rare occasions.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.960
To you, destroying the Slates would mean

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:10.210
revenge for Suoh Mikoto's death.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:14.630
True, but it's not quite that simple.

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:17.680
The Slates gave him life, and also killed him...

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:20.470
It gave us many things, but also took.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:24.680
It's not like destroying the Slates
will give me gratification.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:29.730
But I've come to feel that
it's something that must be destroyed.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:34.360
I do agree that the Slates is a dangerous thing.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.610
However, the late Gold King
Kokujoji Daikaku is the one

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:44.950
that made our nation become what it is today.

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.120
To put it another way,

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.960
the Slates system is deeply rooted in this nation.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.250
We cannot lose it.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:56.010
We can't be talking like that anymore.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.510
Hisui will release the power of the Slates...

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:01.340
in order to give every person superpowers.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.140
If that should happen...

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:11.560
Yes, that must be prevented at all cost.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:14.570
But if the Green King hopes for a revolution,

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.400
and the Red King has decided on destruction...

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:20.860
I, the Blue King, will aim for order.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:25.280
The Slates must be regulated and used appropriately.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:29.290
The way you are now,
I doubt that you can pull it off.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.920
Oh?

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.960
Anna is worried about you too.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:41.680
Your sword is at its limit.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.930
If you overexert yourself, it will fall.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:47.930
Is it something to laugh about?

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.730
Excuse me.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:54.440
I just thought it was ironic that
the situation has reversed from a year ago.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.190
Reversed?

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:00.530
I also tried reasoning with the Red King once.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.870
Although it was in vain.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.160
Reisi.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.200
Yes?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.210
You're not like Mikoto.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:29.970
Stop, Red King.

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:33.270
This matter is under
the jurisdiction of SCEPTER 4.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.900
That's not my problem.

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.650
The Strains you arrested a while ago...

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:41.990
They pulled some stunts in our territory.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.280
We have some questions we want to ask,

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.990
so could you hand them over to us?

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.870
Captain...?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:52.910
You know we will not comply with such a request.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.500
As always, you people are nothing but trouble...

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.350
Burn them.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:14.350
No blood! No bone! No ash!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.850
We will advance with sword in hand!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.020
For our cause is pure!

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.110
Men! Draw your swords!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.150
Akiyama, ready!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.110
Benzai, ready!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:24.990
Kamo, ready!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.030
Domyoji, ready!

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:26.950
Enomoto, ready!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:27.820
Fuse, ready!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:28.700
Goto, ready!

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.240
Hidaka, ready!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.540
Fushimi, ready!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.830
Awashima, ready!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.380
Munakata, ready!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.720
Totsuka...

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:45.800
You got it.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.300
Let's go, Anna.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.600
Mikoto...

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:03.530
Your reckless use of power is incurable.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.110
I don't need a lecture.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.280
Then I shall stop you with force!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.410
Let's see you handle this... Suoh Mikoto!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.420
Kusanagi Izumo! Stand down!

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.470
Sorry, Seri-chan.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.380
But no can do.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:31.140
I know you can do better than that!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:33.930
I'm impressed.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.390
However...

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.690
Mikoto...

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.570
It's okay.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:48.240
That's just the Kings saying hello to each other.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.320
Tatara... Be serious.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.280
Sorry.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.830
But I don't think we should worry.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.370
King and Munakata-san are fighting,

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:01.750
but I bet they're communicating through their swords.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:06.260
I must say, you are a very unpleasant man.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:10.380
I've lost count of how many times you've
interfered since I've become the Blue King.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.640
That's my line.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:18.390
Our King's power shouldn't be wasted in this manner.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.770
And who decided such a thing?

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.400
Surely, it's not a matter of who decides?

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:29.110
Simply, whoever wields power
must be responsible in its use.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:32.910
That coming from you? You seem to be enjoying it?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.410
Surely, you jest.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.790
Using power without order.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.670
Running without a goal.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.080
Destroying without creating.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:47.710
The title "King of Fire" indeed suits you well.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.670
Burning up into ashes without purpose.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.050
Honestly, you...

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.840
"Make me sick"?

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:56.350
Yes, precisely.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:59.270
Good, we see eye to eye.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.480
The name "King of Order" suits you fine too.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.690
Trying to meddle with other people's lives

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:08.320
with your long and boring lectures.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.650
Seriously, you...

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:10.860
"Make me sick"?

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.150
Yeah, exactly...

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:18.040
Don't you ever get tired of always
being such a straight arrow?

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:21.540
Of course not, I'm not like you.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.420
Hah... probably not.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.470
You're not like Mikoto.

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.090
I never dreamed the day would come

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.640
where I'd be the one being admonished.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.600
I was so sure his was a foolish path.

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.440
Reisi...

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:48.440
In any case, the alliance
of three kings is no longer valid.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:50.940
What're you saying?

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:54.150
Yesterday, I received a notice from the government

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:57.370
relieving me of my duties as captain.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:02.450
I'm no longer able to assist you
as the leader of my clan.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.790
Even if you're no longer the captain,

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.170
you're still the Blue King.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.460
What happens to the Blues,

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:12.710
your clansmen, who are at a loss right now?

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:19.430
Reisi!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.570
We'll use this method to destroy the Slates.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:34.900
Is such a thing really possible?

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:38.950
Until now, it was believed
the Slates were indestructible.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:42.870
So even the Green King would not expect this.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.830
It's the one way to fix this hopeless situation.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:48.580
But isn't such a method really dangerous?

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:53.710
Well, I'll just have to ask that
you trust me as a researcher.

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.970
I do! I do, I do!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.930
I believe in you, Shiro!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:02.720
Thank you, Neko.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.350
You're a good girl.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.730
I believe in you too!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.360
Of course, I believe in you.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:19.360
We'll do what we must together...

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.240
And then come home together as well.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:30.830
Don't worry.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:35.210
I made sure that this plan
includes me coming out of it alive.

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.930
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.760
There's something I want to give you both.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.430
Here, look.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.020
What's this?

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:53.770
Well, we didn't have a clan name or clan symbol.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.280
I was a bit jealous of the other clans.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:18:59.780
I see...

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:03.780
So this is our clan symbol?

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.790
And while we're at it, I thought...

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:09.540
It's so shiny and pretty!
we should give the clan a name.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:10.290
Kuro, will you do the honor?
It's so shiny and pretty!

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:11.380
Kuro, will you do the honor?

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:12.540
Me?

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.550
Yes, think of something really cool.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.170
All right...

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.550
Let's see...

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:25.560
What best describes us?

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:31.560
Hakumai (white rice)...

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.570
Okay, I've decided.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:40.570
Our clan name is...

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.070
The name is...?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.700
"HAKUMAITOU"! (White Rice Party)

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.710
What?!

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.580
Yes...

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.090
Rice is a staple of our diet.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.000
It's the foundation of a healthy body.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:00.470
And you love white rice...

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:01.340
Right?

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.220
Uh, yeah...

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:05.720
HAKUMAITOU!

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:11.850
<i>Inside a white rice is where you
will discover your true happiness</i>

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:17.610
Since we're always at the table,

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.730
I guess it fits us perfectly.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:23.070
All right. We're the HAKUMAITOU.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.070
We'll stick together and do our best!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.330
Yes! Let's do our best!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:32.750
Neko, Hisui Nagare called you Ameno Miyabi.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.590
He must have looked into your past
and knows about you before you became Neko.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.090
If we question him...

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:40.590
Shiro!

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.880
I am Neko!

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.720
I am your cat, Shiro!

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.180
Y-You're right...

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.600
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:52.390
Both Neko and I are here as your friends.

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.480
That's all that matters.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:57.190
I'm going to follow you to the end,

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:00.360
and I won't be a burden to you.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:01.780
Me too!

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.780
Yes! Let's go together.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.160
And the first thing to do...

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:10.620
is to find JUNGLE's headquarters.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.210
Shiro!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.330
What's wrong, Shiro?!

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.170
Shiro?! Are you okay, Shiro?

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:22.840
Anna?!

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:23.760
What's wrong?!

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.340
The Slates...

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:32.890
So... It's finally here.

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:34.730
Yes, it's here.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.770
The Slates are about to be liberated...

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:38.650
To be set free.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:41.320
The time of revolution...

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:42.730
is finally among us!

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:55.000
So it has begun...

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:59.380
Then again, it saves me the trouble
of having to look for them.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.840
Although I don't know how long I can last...

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:08.390
I'll keep running until I reach my limit.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.640
<i>That's unlike you...</i> <i>Munakata.</i>

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:19.440
I know, right?

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:02.000
The Slates awaken to change the world...

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.790
And the kings assemble before the pillar of light.

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:07.380
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:10.050
#11 "Kali-yuga".

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:12.180
I will not let you have it your way!
